<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐγάλακτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yielding much</i> or <i>good milk</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.121
				</span></i>
			: heterocl. nom. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐγάλακτες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔτροφοι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐγάλακτον, τό</span>, a plant, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλαύξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				27.82
			</span></i>.</div>
